{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013HuHNeMsf51P8HJJaZztAE","type":"tool_result","content":"    Finished `dev` profile [optimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 3m 10s\nexit 0\n[workspace]\nresolver = \"3\"\nmembers = [\"crates/*\"]\n\n[workspace.package]\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2024\"\npublish = false\n\n[workspace.dependencies]\nab_glyph = \"0.2\"\nepaint_default_fonts = \"0.36\"\npav_core = { path = \"crates/pav_core\" }\npav_render = { path = \"crates/pav_render\" }\npav_view = { path = \"crates/pav_view\" }\npav_tools = { path = \"crates/pav_tools\" }\npav_ui = { path = \"crates/pav_ui\" }\npav_audio = { path = \"crates/pav_audio\" }\nglam = { version = \"0.33\", features = [\"serde\", \"bytemuck\"] }\n# Vulkan + DX12 only (no OpenGL); \"webgpu\" is for the later browser build.\nwgpu = { version = \"30\", default-features = false, features = [\"std\", \"parking_lot\", \"dx12\", \"vulkan\", \"wgsl\", \"webgpu\"] }\nwinit = \"0.30.13\"\negui = \"0.36.2\"\negui-wgpu = { version = \"0.36.2\", default-features = false }\negui-winit = { version = \"0.36.2\", default-features = false, features = [\"links\"] }\ngilrs = \"0.11\"\ncpal = \"0.18\"\npng = \"0.18\"\n# The asset importer (pav_tools): Wavefront OBJ/MTL. 4.0.3 is the newest release at least 12\n# months old (doctrine 9); no default features, so no dependencies.\ntobj = { version = \"4.0.3\", default-features = false }\nserde = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\", \"rc\"] }\nserde_json = \"1\"\ntoml = \"1\"\nnotify = \"8\"\nciborium = \"0.2\"\nanyhow = \"1\"\n# The motion importer (pav_tools): fdlibm's trigonometry, as JavaScript engines use it, and\n# inflate for single files out of zip archives on the web.\nlibm = \"0.2\"\nminiz_oxide = \"0.8\"\nlog = \"0.4\"\nbytemuck = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }\npollster = \"1\"\nweb-time = \"1\"\n# Browser build only.\nwasm-bindgen = \"0.2\"\nwasm-bindgen-futures = \"0.4\"\nweb-sys = \"0.3\"\n\n[workspace.lints.clippy]\n# Style lints that fight readable game code.\ncollapsible_if = \"allow\"\ncollapsible_match = \"allow\"\ntype_complexity = \"allow\"\ntoo_many_arguments = \"allow\"\n\n[profile.dev]\nopt-level = 1\n# Keeps the target folder small (cloud containers have a fixed disk allowance); backtraces\n[target.x86_64-pc-windows-gnu]\nlinker = \"x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc\"\n[toolchain]\nchannel = \"1.98.1\"\ncomponents = [\"rustfmt\", \"clippy\"]\ntargets = [\"x86_64-pc-windows-gnu\"]\n58:[profile.dev]\n59-opt-level = 1\n60-# Keeps the target folder small (cloud containers have a fixed disk allowance); backtraces\n61-# still show file:line.\n62-debug = \"line-tables-only\"\n63-incremental = false\n64-\n65:[profile.dev.package.\"*\"]\n66-opt-level = 3\n67-debug = false\n68-\n69:[profile.release]\n70-debug = \"line-tables-only\"\n71-\n72-# Distribution build (what gets sent to the user): smaller, still has function names in crash reports.\n73:[profile.dist]\n74-inherits = \"release\"\n75-debug = false\n76-strip = \"debuginfo\"\n//! Shardfall's game UI, drawn with egui: the HUD (`arpg_ui`), the inventory, shop, stash and\n//! character windows (`arpg_items`), the passive tree (`arpg_tree`) and the touch controls\n//! (`touch`). The window (`pav_app`) draws it over the game; the tools draw the same code on a\n//! headless context (`headless`): a text reading of what is on screen, and the UI over captures.\n\npub mod arpg_items;\npub mod arpg_tree;\npub mod arpg_ui;\npub mod headless;\npub mod touch;\n\n/// The input device the player is on: hints and the HUD follow it.\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Default)]\npub enum Device {\n    #[default]\n    KeyboardMouse,\n    Gamepad,\n    /// A phone or tablet (touch.rs).\n    Touch,\n}\n\n/// Touch screens: bigger targets, a little bigger text, thicker scroll bars, and dragging\n/// scrolls. `on = false` puts the desktop sizes back.\npub fn touch_style(ctx: &egui::Context, on: bool) {\n    use egui::{FontId, TextStyle};\n    ctx.all_styles_mut(|s| {\n        s.spacing = egui::style::Spacing::default();\n        s.text_styles = egui::style::default_text_styles();\n        if on {\n            let sp = &mut s.spacing;\n            sp.interact_size = egui::vec2(44.0, 34.0);\n            sp.button_padding = egui::vec2(12.0, 7.0);\n            sp.item_spacing = egui::vec2(10.0, 8.0);\n            sp.slider_width = 170.0;\n            sp.icon_width = 20.0;\n            sp.icon_width_inner = 12.0;\n            sp.combo_height = 320.0;\n            sp.scroll = egui::style::ScrollStyle::solid();\n            sp.scroll.bar_width = 8.0;\n            for (style, size) in\n                [(TextStyle::Body, 15.0), (TextStyle::Button, 15.0), (TextStyle::Small, 12.0), (TextStyle::Heading, 20.0)]\n            {\n                s.text_styles.insert(style, FontId::proportional(size));\n            }\n            s.interaction.tooltip_delay = 0.35;\n        }\n    });\n}\n\n/// A `pav_core::games` game's HUD lines (`Game::hud`), top left.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33b9a197-b2fe-42e5-9a43-b32ae2dde858","uuid":"9ca56d46-62f4-4416-8347-844399c22c18","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:25:40.327Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"    Finished `dev` profile [optimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 3m 10s\nexit 0\n[workspace]\nresolver = \"3\"\nmembers = [\"crates/*\"]\n\n[workspace.package]\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2024\"\npublish = false\n\n[workspace.dependencies]\nab_glyph = \"0.2\"\nepaint_default_fonts = \"0.36\"\npav_core = { path = \"crates/pav_core\" }\npav_render = { path = \"crates/pav_render\" }\npav_view = { path = \"crates/pav_view\" }\npav_tools = { path = \"crates/pav_tools\" }\npav_ui = { path = \"crates/pav_ui\" }\npav_audio = { path = \"crates/pav_audio\" }\nglam = { version = \"0.33\", features = [\"serde\", \"bytemuck\"] }\n# Vulkan + DX12 only (no OpenGL); \"webgpu\" is for the later browser build.\nwgpu = { version = \"30\", default-features = false